[00:00.98]Lesson 69 | 第69课
[00:03.50]The car race | 汽车比赛
[00:06.29]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.10]Which car was the winner in 1995? | 1995年哪辆车获胜了?
[00:19.15]There is a car race near our town every year. | 每年我们镇附近都有一场汽车比赛。
[00:25.36]In 1995, there was a very big race. | 1995年,有一场非常大的比赛。
[00:32.20]There were hundreds of people there. | 那里有数百人。
[00:36.03]My wife and I were at the race. | 我妻子和我观看了比赛。
[00:40.28]Our friends Julie and Jack were there, too. | 我们的朋友朱莉和杰克也在那儿。
[00:45.61]You can see us in the crowd. | 你可以在人群中看到我们。
[00:49.48]We are standing on the left. | 我们站在左边。
[00:53.98]There were twenty cars in the race. | 比赛中有二十辆车。
[00:58.25]There were English cars, French cars, German cars, Italian cars, American cars and Japanese cars. | 有英国车、法国车、德国车、意大利车、美国车和日本车。
[01:11.87]It was an exciting finish. | 比赛结果激动人心。
[01:15.69]The winner was Billy Stewart. | 获胜者是比利·斯图尔特。
[01:19.44]He was in car number fifteen. | 他驾驶的是15号车。
[01:23.53]Five other cars were just behind him. | 另外五辆车紧随其后。
[01:29.07]On the way home, my wife said to me, 'Don't drive so quickly! | 回家的路上,我的妻子对我说:'别开得这么快!
[01:37.31]You're not Billy Stewart!' | 你不是比利·斯图尔特!'